{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"！！！5月19日！！！\n名古屋にて握手会をさせていただきましたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いなかありがと３！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが熱中症にならんかめっちゃ心配で.........( ; ゜Д゜)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に、幸せなな気持ちで握手会終わって良かったです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次がまちどうしぃ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どうしよう？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初めての方、\n久しぶりの方、\nいつもの方、\n来てくださりありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかったゼゼゼゼゼーーーーイ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『狼に口笛を』\nを披露させていただいたんですけど、\nどうでしたか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"PVよりも成長した姿が見てほしくて皆で頑張りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンスなんかは練習の成果が発揮できました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"反省点は、やっぱりdanceも激しくて........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"歌ってるときに\n『ボフッ』\nってたまにマイクに息のかかる音がしちゃいました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もっと練習します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0009.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はツインテールしたー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっとこれでツインは最後だよっ........."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイとマアヤ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイはいつもいい臭いがするの〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何の香りだろー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのねぇ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイはねぇとってもいいおねぇちゃんでねぇ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マアヤがまだ広島から通ってるときに、いつもキャリーバックを持って移動してたのっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"駅の階段を下りたり上がったりするのは大変なのっ！\nそしたら\n『かして！』\nっていってサッとバックをもってくれたの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『いいよ×2！』\nっていっても返してくれなくて......\n本当に気遣いの出来るいいおねぇちゃんです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつか恩返しがしたいのだっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"マイマイいつもありがとー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のblogのタイトルは握手会の時、ファンのかたに付けていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私のワガママに答えてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近食べた美味しいものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はLAWSONのネバネバサラダにハマってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは何か、\n『もちっとした』\nとか\n『もちもち』\nとか書いてあるものを何でも買ってしまいます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では朝から、お仕事に学校に！\nいっぱい頑張っていきましょー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/05/20/1016899/0008.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}